      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "this would be useful for stuff like modular avatar because when there is a phys bone component on something when a MA object is added on, the bone would also be applied to that object. \n\nexample: \n\n1. PB applied to head with ignoring face stuff so the hair is only 1 PB component\n\n2. glasses are applied to head by MA component\n\n3. now glasses have PB on them when uploaded because they where not added to head PB ignore list\n\nwith the 'Apply bone only' function you can tell the SDK which bone chains to only apply the PB component to. then when you add stuff with MA the bones are only applied to the bone chains you say it should",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
